							"parentStyle": false,
							"left": 8,
							"top": 1024,
							"width": 104.5380859375,
							"height": 174,
							"text": "\n- wher should be the attitude?\n- separate Athmospheric modeling from satellite aero modelling? yes\nv_rel asl paramter für force"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGcGsVtHKyoQzM=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"fillColor": "#A3FFA3",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"parentStyle": false,
							"left": 8,
							"top": 1248,
							"width": 152,
							"height": 79,
							"text": "- alpha_e surface material abhängig?\nplinsiki: dichte und gas temperatur abhängig -° also aeroparameter"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGcGsdisdOLWlE=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"fillColor": "#A3FFA3",
							"font": "Arial;13;0",
							"parentStyle": false,
							"left": 8,
							"top": 1496,
							"width": 100,
							"height": 170,
							"text": "encapsulate athmosphere data in one class, to clean up function arguements?\nYes for this case for example structs are a goof choixe"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGcGuQiKpIOgms=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"fillColor": "#FFADAD",
